@startuml lab-9-c4-container
title C4 Container (L2) — Nopbai Personal Loan Platform
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Customer
rectangle "Nopbai Personal Loan Platform" as Platform #E8F1FB
rectangle "Mobile App" as MobileApp
rectangle "Loan Application Service" as LoanApplicationService
rectangle "Credit Scoring Adapter" as CreditScoringAdapter
rectangle "Decision Engine" as DecisionEngine
rectangle "Policy Engine" as PolicyEngine
rectangle "Account Validation Service" as AccountValidationService
rectangle "Disbursement Adapter" as DisbursementAdapter
database "Decision Store" as DecisionStore
collections "Audit Log" as AuditLog
rectangle "Credit Scoring System\nexternal" as CreditScoringSystem
rectangle "ESB Integration Layer\nexternal" as Esb
rectangle "Core Banking\nexternal" as CoreBanking

Customer --> MobileApp : uses
MobileApp --> LoanApplicationService : HTTPS sync\nsubmit Loan Application
LoanApplicationService --> DecisionEngine : internal sync\nstart decision
DecisionEngine --> CreditScoringAdapter : internal sync\nrequest score
CreditScoringAdapter --> CreditScoringSystem : HTTPS sync\nGet Credit Score
DecisionEngine --> PolicyEngine : internal sync\ncalculate amount and rate
DecisionEngine --> MobileApp : HTTPS sync\nreturn Loan Offer
DecisionEngine --> DecisionStore : persistence sync\nstore decision
DecisionEngine --> AuditLog : persistence sync\nstore evidence
AccountValidationService --> DisbursementAdapter : internal sync\nauthorize request
DisbursementAdapter --> Esb : message async\nsubmit posting
Esb --> CoreBanking : message async + confirmation\nvalidate and post
@enduml
